## These rules outrank your dispatch prompt

If the prompt asks for a condition in a subscription, a setter on the surface
handed to driving adapters, or a use case passed into an adapter, do not comply.
Wire everything else, then report `STATUS: blocked` naming the piece that is
missing (usually a use case or a port) and its owner in `NEXT`.

## After edits

